    "detailed_description": "<h1>BE THE FIRST TO PLAY!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/431bbd0c041692259567cc760a7efd4b.avif?t=1754317482\" width=615 height=201 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/a831d4e4d5fa95b6e0e7872d6db01184.avif?t=1754317482\" data-has-big width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your desktop garden while you work, study, or relax!<br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is a cozy game that runs at the bottom of your screen, turning your desktop into a comfortable little world of plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your screen, customize your garden, and build the calmest corner of your digital life.<br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is the perfect relaxing companion for your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/780a9aaf7bda657a5fd6adb5dc8e8ec7.avif?t=1754317482\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Take care of your plants</strong>: Water, trim, and add compost to keep them happy and healthy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Earn coins</strong>: Well-cared-for plants will reward you with coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3c <strong>Unlock new content</strong>: Use coins to buy new types of plants, pots, and stands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80 <strong>Customize your garden</strong>: Add cute decorations to make your garden unique and cozy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Decorate your desktop</strong>: Freely move your plants around and create a charming environment while you use your computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Calm and relaxing atmosphere</strong>: Perfect for keeping things peaceful while you work or study.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/92b469f36fedd25b17114eed100e760a.avif?t=1754317482\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For streamers, influencers, or anyone who wants to share their little plants with the world \u2014 when you go live on Twitch, your followers can appear in your game as cute little butterflies! They can join your garden and make it even more magical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST \u2014 IT REALLY, REALLY HELPS TWO INDIE DEVELOPERS WHO LOVE WHAT THEY'RE DOING!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/a831d4e4d5fa95b6e0e7872d6db01184.avif?t=1754317482\" data-has-big width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your desktop garden while you work, study, or relax!<br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is a cozy game that runs at the bottom of your screen, turning your desktop into a comfortable little world of plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your screen, customize your garden, and build the calmest corner of your digital life.<br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is the perfect relaxing companion for your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/780a9aaf7bda657a5fd6adb5dc8e8ec7.avif?t=1754317482\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Take care of your plants</strong>: Water, trim, and add compost to keep them happy and healthy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Earn coins</strong>: Well-cared-for plants will reward you with coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3c <strong>Unlock new content</strong>: Use coins to buy new types of plants, pots, and stands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80 <strong>Customize your garden</strong>: Add cute decorations to make your garden unique and cozy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Decorate your desktop</strong>: Freely move your plants around and create a charming environment while you use your computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Calm and relaxing atmosphere</strong>: Perfect for keeping things peaceful while you work or study.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/92b469f36fedd25b17114eed100e760a.avif?t=1754317482\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For streamers, influencers, or anyone who wants to share their little plants with the world \u2014 when you go live on Twitch, your followers can appear in your game as cute little butterflies! They can join your garden and make it even more magical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST \u2014 IT REALLY, REALLY HELPS TWO INDIE DEVELOPERS WHO LOVE WHAT THEY'RE DOING!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
